
### TEST 1 - GET sve narudzbe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### TEST 2 - GET po id-u
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### TEST 3 - pravljenje nove narudzbe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "shippingName": "Hamo Hamic",
  "shippingStreet": "Marsala Tita 10",
  "shippingCity": "Zenica",
  "shippingPostalCode": "72000",
  "shippingCountry": "Bosnia and Herzegovina",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

